  "adapterAlgorithm": [
    "Resolve and hash every input under the canonical repository root; reject absolute, traversal, missing, non-regular, or symlink-escaping paths.",
    "Strictly validate source-stage-v2 semantic shape and all referenced artifact hashes.",
    "Require source_candidate and candidateReadyForIndependentReview=true while every admission, quarantine, shipping, and selection flag remains false.",
    "Require direction, task, branch, logicalID, sourceKey, bridge, appearance lock, registration socket, frontage, pivot, contact, alpha, and shadow bindings to agree.",
    "Require exact A/B/C completion, selected-process identity, three unique LOD decoded hashes and sizes, eight unique D4 fingerprints, null fallback, and PASS validation gates.",
    "Construct renderer-packet-v2 by the declared field mapping and encode with sorted keys and no insignificant whitespace.",
    "Reopen and revalidate the emitted packet; emit a deterministic adapter receipt binding input and output SHA-256 values.",
    "Stop for Integration independent review; only Integration may issue source-admission-receipt-v1.",
    "Renderer reopens the exact packet/admission pair and emits one direction-local nonshipping quarantine receipt.",
    "At zero through three receipts emit inactive or quarantined_incomplete only.",
    "At exact North/East/South/West receipt parity, require Integration assembly-input-manifest-v1 and invoke the existing 4/4 join exactly once.",
    "Emit atomic-admission-ledger-v1 with 12 unique LOD and 32 unique D4 identities while every runtime, shipping, and production flag remains false."
  ],
